  "scope": "Recovery inside the inherited support-gated renewal law. An active route with positive net contribution throughout a finite window restores sustaining support by the deficit bound. If both activities are unsupported, the level is invariant despite later nominal contribution inputs. Two actual input histories have the same initial condition and future inputs but differ in recovery; a recovered history is neither all-time renewing nor permanently consuming. The law, thresholds, contribution schedule and physical correspondence remain supplied. No general irreversibility, unique ontology, ethical or axiom-free foundation claim."
